{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Build me a modern, mobile-friendly Shopify footer with multiple editable containers.
    
    General Requirements:
    	•	The footer must be responsive and display correctly on all devices (desktop, tablet, and mobile).
    	•	Each container must allow me to adjust padding (top, bottom, left, right).
    	•	Each container can be toggled on/off.
    	•	Clean, minimal, professional design.
    
    Container 1 (Accordion, Left Side):
    	•	Accordion with + icon when closed and – icon when open.
    	•	Titles and inner content must be editable (example: “About” → About Us + Privacy Policy; “Support” → FAQs + Contact Us).
    	•	I must be able to add, remove, or edit accordion items in the future.
    	•	Smooth open/close animation.
    
    Container 2 (Center):
    	•	Newsletter signup form (editable text + input field + submit button).
    	•	Entire section can be toggled on/off.
    
    Container 3 (Center):
    	•	Social media icons (Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, etc.) with editable links.
    	•	Ability to add or remove icons in the future.
    	•	Toggleable on/off.
    
    Container 4 (Bottom, Center):
    	•	Copyright text (default: “© 2025, MUJŌ CO”) but must be editable.
    
    Extra Notes:
    	•	All text, links, and content must be editable inside Shopify.
    	•	Fully responsive and works seamlessly across desktop, tablet, and mobile., Create a modern, responsive Shopify footer with editable containers. Each container must have padding controls (top, bottom, left, right) and an on/off toggle.
    
    Container 1 (Accordion Section, Left Side):
    	•	Accordion with + (closed) and – (open) icons.
    	•	Each accordion item must be fully editable (title + inside content).
    	•	I can link items directly to Shopify pages (About Us, Privacy Policy, FAQs, Contact Us, etc.).
    	•	Ability to add/remove accordion items in the future.
    
    Container 2 (Newsletter, Center, Toggle On/Off):
    	•	Editable title and description.
    	•	Newsletter signup form (email input + submit button).
    
    Container 3 (Social Media, Center, Toggle On/Off):
    	•	Use the default Shopify social icons (like the ones in my theme: Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, etc.).
    	•	Each icon must be clickable and link to my social media profiles.
    	•	Ability to add/remove icons in the future.
    
    Container 4 (Bottom, Center):
    	•	Editable copyright text (default: “© 2025, MUJŌ CO”).
    
    Requirements:
    	•	Fully responsive on desktop, tablet, and mobile.
    	•	Clean, minimal, modern design.
    	•	Smooth accordion animation.
    	•	All content editable directly in Shopify., Create a modern, responsive Shopify footer with editable containers. Each container must have padding controls (top, bottom, left, right) and an on/off toggle.
    
    Container 1 (Accordion Section, Left Side):
    	•	Accordion with + (closed) and – (open) icons.
    	•	Each accordion item must be fully editable (title + inside content).
    	•	I can link items directly to Shopify pages (About Us, Privacy Policy, FAQs, Contact Us, etc.).
    	•	Ability to add/remove accordion items in the future.
    
    Container 2 (Newsletter, Center, Toggle On/Off):
    	•	Editable title and description.
    	•	Newsletter signup form (email input + submit button).
    
    Container 3 (Social Media, Center, Toggle On/Off):
    	•	Use the default generic Shopify social media icons (Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, etc.).
    	•	Each icon must allow me to add my own link.
    	•	Ability to add/remove icons in the future.
    
    Container 4 (Bottom, Center):
    	•	Editable copyright text (default: “© 2025, MUJŌ CO”).
    
    Requirements:
    	•	Fully responsive on desktop, tablet, and mobile.
    	•	Clean, minimal, modern design.
    	•	Smooth accordion animation.
    	•	All content editable directly in Shopify.
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-footer-inner-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 9600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 24px 16px;
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.footer_background_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.footer_text_color }};
    font-family: "Figtree", sans-serif;
    font-weight: {{ settings.type_body_font.weight }};
  }

  .ai-footer-main-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    gap: 20px; /* reduce vertical space between accordion and newsletter */
  }

  .ai-footer-accordion-container-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-footer-newsletter-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .ai-footer-accordion-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;  /* span across all columns */
      width: 100%;          /* take up the whole row */
    }
  }

  .ai-footer-accordion-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba({{ block.settings.footer_text_color | color_extract: 'red' }}, {{ block.settings.footer_text_color | color_extract: 'green' }}, {{ block.settings.footer_text_color | color_extract: 'blue' }}, 0.2);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .ai-footer-accordion-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 16px 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: left;
    color: inherit;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ai-footer-accordion-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-footer-accordion-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  .ai-footer-accordion-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: max-height 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-footer-accordion-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    max-height: 500px;
  }

  .ai-footer-accordion-links-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .ai-footer-accordion-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    color: {{ block.settings.footer_text_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 8px 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    opacity: 0.8;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-footer-accordion-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .ai-footer-newsletter-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    grid-column: 1 / -1; /* Makes newsletter span full width row */
    order: 2;            /* Forces it to appear after accordion */
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-footer-newsletter-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: {{ block.settings.footer_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-footer-newsletter-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    opacity: 0.8;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ai-footer-newsletter-form-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    max-width: 300px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-footer-newsletter-input-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border: {{ settings.inputs_border_thickness }}px solid rgba({{ block.settings.footer_text_color | color_extract: 'red' }}, {{ block.settings.footer_text_color | color_extract: 'green' }}, {{ block.settings.footer_text_color | color_extract: 'blue' }}, {{ settings.inputs_border_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }});
    border-radius: {{ settings.inputs_radius }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.footer_background_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.footer_text_color }};
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .ai-footer-newsletter-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}::placeholder {
    color:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-footer-newsletter-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 10px 12px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.newsletter_button_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.newsletter_button_text_color }};
    border: none;
    border-radius: {{ settings.buttons_radius }}px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-footer-newsletter-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.newsletter_button_hover_color }};
  }

  .ai-footer-newsletter-message-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .ai-footer-newsletter-success-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: #10b981;
  }

  .ai-footer-newsletter-error-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: #ef4444;
  }

  .ai-footer-social-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: {{ block.settings.social_padding_top }}px {{ block.settings.social_padding_right }}px {{ block.settings.social_padding_bottom }}px {{ block.settings.social_padding_left }}px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-footer-social-icons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .ai-footer-social-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    color: {{ block.settings.footer_text_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, opacity 0.3s ease;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .ai-footer-social-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .ai-footer-social-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .ai-footer-copyright-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding-top: 8px !important;
    padding-bottom: 8px !important;
    text-align: center;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba({{ block.settings.footer_text_color | color_extract: 'red' }}, {{ block.settings.footer_text_color | color_extract: 'green' }}, {{ block.settings.footer_text_color | color_extract: 'blue' }}, 0.2);
    margin-top: 0px;
  }

  .ai-footer-copyright-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 990px) {
    .ai-footer-main-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .ai-footer-accordion-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      order: 3;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-footer-main-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .ai-footer-newsletter-form-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    .ai-footer-social-icons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .ai-footer-accordion-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      order: 1;
    }

    .ai-footer-newsletter-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      order: 2;
    }

    .ai-footer-social-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      order: 3;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<footer-accordion-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-footer-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    
    <!-- 🟢 New wrapper for centering content -->
    <div class="ai-footer-inner-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-footer-main-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.show_accordion %}
        <div class="ai-footer-accordion-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% for i in (1..6) %}
            {% liquid
              assign accordion_enabled_key = 'accordion_' | append: i | append: '_enabled'
              assign accordion_title_key = 'accordion_' | append: i | append: '_title'
              assign accordion_enabled = block.settings[accordion_enabled_key]
              assign accordion_title = block.settings[accordion_title_key]
            %}

            {% if accordion_enabled and accordion_title != blank %}
              <div class="ai-footer-accordion-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <button
                  class="ai-footer-accordion-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  aria-expanded="false"
                  data-accordion-toggle="{{ i }}"
                >
                  <span>{{ accordion_title }}</span>
                  <svg class="ai-footer-accordion-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"></line>
                    <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
                  </svg>
                </button>
                <div class="ai-footer-accordion-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-accordion-content="{{ i }}">
                  <div class="ai-footer-accordion-links-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    {% for j in (1..4) %}
                      {% liquid
                        assign page_key = 'accordion_' | append: i | append: '_page_' | append: j
                        assign page = block.settings[page_key]
                      %}
                      {% if page != blank %}
                        <a href="{{ page.url }}" class="ai-footer-accordion-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                          {{ page.title }}
                        </a>
                      {% endif %}
                    {% endfor %}
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.show_newsletter %}
        <div class="ai-footer-newsletter-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.newsletter_title != blank %}
            <h3 class="ai-footer-newsletter-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.newsletter_title }}</h3>
          {% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.newsletter_description != blank %}
            <p class="ai-footer-newsletter-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.newsletter_description }}</p>
          {% endif %}
          
          {% form 'customer' %}
            <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="newsletter">
            <div class="ai-footer-newsletter-form-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <input
                type="email"
                name="contact[email]"
                class="ai-footer-newsletter-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                placeholder="{{ block.settings.newsletter_placeholder }}"
                value="{{ form.email }}"
                aria-required="true"
                autocorrect="off"
                autocapitalize="off"
                autocomplete="email"
                {% if form.errors %}
                  aria-invalid="true"
                  aria-describedby="ai-footer-newsletter-error-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                {% endif %}
                {% if form.posted_successfully? %}
                  aria-describedby="ai-footer-newsletter-success-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                {% endif %}
                required
              >
              <button type="submit" class="ai-footer-newsletter-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.newsletter_button_text }}
              </button>
            </div>
            {% if form.errors %}
              <div id="ai-footer-newsletter-error-{{ ai_gen_id }}" class="ai-footer-newsletter-message-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-footer-newsletter-error-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ form.errors.messages.email }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
            {% if form.posted_successfully? %}
              <div id="ai-footer-newsletter-success-{{ ai_gen_id }}" class="ai-footer-newsletter-message-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-footer-newsletter-success-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.newsletter_success_message }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          {% endform %}
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.show_social %}
        <div class="ai-footer-social-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-footer-social-icons-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.social_facebook_url != blank %}
              <a href="{{ block.settings.social_facebook_url }}" class="ai-footer-social-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Facebook">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                  <path d="M24 12.073c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12s-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.99 4.388 10.954 10.125 11.854v-8.385H7.078v-3.47h3.047V9.43c0-3.007 1.792-4.669 4.533-4.669 1.312 0 2.686.235 2.686.235v2.953H15.83c-1.491 0-1.956.925-1.956 1.874v2.25h3.328l-.532 3.47h-2.796v8.385C19.612 23.027 24 18.062 24 12.073z"/>
                </svg>
              </a>
            {% endif %}

            {% if block.settings.social_instagram_url != blank %}
              <a href="{{ block.settings.social_instagram_url }}" class="ai-footer-social-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Instagram">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                  <path d="M12 2.163c3.204 0 3.584.012 4.85.07 3.252.148 4.771 1.691 4.919 4.919.058 1.265.069 1.645.069 4.849 0 3.205-.012 3.584-.069 4.849-.149 3.225-1.664 4.771-4.919 4.919-1.266.058-1.644.07-4.85.07-3.204 0-3.584-.012-4.849-.07-3.26-.149-4.771-1.699-4.919-4.92-.058-1.265-.07-1.644-.07-4.849 0-3.204.013-3.583.07-4.849.149-3.227 1.664-4.771 4.919-4.919 1.266-.057 1.645-.069 4.849-.069zm0-2.163c-3.259 0-3.667.014-4.947.072-4.358.2-6.78 2.618-6.98 6.98-.059 1.281-.073 1.689-.073 4.948 0 3.259.014 3.668.072 4.948.2 4.358 2.618 6.78 6.98 6.98 1.281.058 1.689.072 4.948.072 3.259 0 3.668-.014 4.948-.072 4.354-.2 6.782-2.618 6.979-6.98.059-1.28.073-1.689.073-4.948 0-3.259-.014-3.667-.072-4.947-.196-4.354-2.617-6.78-6.979-6.98-1.281-.059-1.69-.073-4.949-.073zm0 5.838c-3.403 0-6.162 2.759-6.162 6.162s2.759 6.163 6.162 6.163 6.162-2.759 6.162-6.163c0-3.403-2.759-6.162-6.162-6.162zm0 10.162c-2.209 0-4-1.79-4-4 0-2.209 1.791-4 4-4s4 1.791 4 4c0 2.21-1.791 4-4 4zm6.406-11.845c-.796 0-1.441.645-1.441 1.44s.645 1.44 1.441 1.44c.795 0 1.439-.645 1.439-1.44s-.644-1.44-1.439-1.44z"/>
                </svg>
              </a>
            {% endif %}

            {% if block.settings.social_tiktok_url != blank %}
              <a href="{{ block.settings.social_tiktok_url }}" class="ai-footer-social-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="TikTok">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                  <path d="M12.525.02c1.31-.02 2.61-.01 3.91-.02.08 1.53.63 3.09 1.75 4.17 1.12 1.11 2.7 1.62 4.24 1.79v4.03c-1.44-.05-2.89-.35-4.2-.97-.57-.26-1.1-.59-1.62-.93-.01 2.92.01 5.84-.02 8.75-.08 1.4-.54 2.79-1.35 3.94-1.31 1.92-3.58 3.17-5.91 3.21-1.43.08-2.86-.31-4.08-1.03-2.02-1.19-3.44-3.37-3.65-5.71-.02-.5-.03-1-.01-1.49.18-1.9 1.12-3.72 2.58-4.96 1.66-1.44 3.98-2.13 6.15-1.72.02 1.48-.04 2.96-.04 4.44-.99-.32-2.15-.23-3.02.37-.63.41-1.11 1.04-1.36 1.75-.21.51-.15 1.07-.14 1.61.24 1.64 1.82 3.02 3.5 2.87 1.12-.01 2.19-.66 2.77-1.61.19-.33.4-.67.41-1.06.1-1.79.06-3.57.07-5.36.01-4.03-.01-8.05.02-12.07z"/>
                </svg>
              </a>
            {% endif %}

            {% if block.settings.social_twitter_url != blank %}
              <a href="{{ block.settings.social_twitter_url }}" class="ai-footer-social-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Twitter">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                  <path d="M23.953 4.57a10 10 0 01-2.825.775 4.958 4.958 0 002.163-2.723c-.951.555-2.005.959-3.127 1.184a4.92 4.92 0 00-8.384 4.482C7.69 8.095 4.067 6.13 1.64 3.162a4.822 4.822 0 00-.666 2.475c0 1.71.87 3.213 2.188 4.096a4.904 4.904 0 01-2.228-.616v.06a4.923 4.923 0 003.946 4.827 4.996 4.996 0 01-2.212.085 4.936 4.936 0 004.604 3.417 9.867 9.867 0 01-6.102 2.105c-.39 0-.779-.023-1.17-.067a13.995 13.995 0 007.557 2.209c9.053 0 13.998-7.496 13.998-13.985 0-.21 0-.42-.015-.63A9.935 9.935 0 0024 4.59z"/>
                </svg>
              </a>
            {% endif %}

            {% if block.settings.social_youtube_url != blank %}
              <a href="{{ block.settings.social_youtube_url }}" class="ai-footer-social-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="YouTube">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                  <path d="M23.498 6.186a3.016 3.016 0 0 0-2.122-2.136C19.505 3.545 12 3.545 12 3.545s-7.505 0-9.377.505A3.017 3.017 0 0 0 .502 6.186C0 8.07 0 12 0 12s0 3.93.502 5.814a3.016 3.016 0 0 0 2.122 2.136c1.871.505 9.376.505 9.376.505s7.505 0 9.377-.505a3.015 3.015 0 0 0 2.122-2.136C24 15.93 24 12 24 12s0-3.93-.502-5.814zM9.545 15.568V8.432L15.818 12l-6.273 3.568z"/>
                </svg>
              </a>
            {% endif %}

            {% if block.settings.social_pinterest_url != blank %}
              <a href="{{ block.settings.social_pinterest_url }}" class="ai-footer-social-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Pinterest">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                  <path d="M12.017 0C5.396 0 .029 5.367.029 11.987c0 5.079 3.158 9.417 7.618 11.174-.105-.949-.199-2.403.041-3.439.219-.937 1.406-5.957 1.406-5.957s-.359-.72-.359-1.781c0-1.663.967-2.911 2.168-2.911 1.024 0 1.518.769 1.518 1.688 0 1.029-.653 2.567-.992 3.992-.285 1.193.6 2.165 1.775 2.165 2.128 0 3.768-2.245 3.768-5.487 0-2.861-2.063-4.869-5.008-4.869-3.41 0-5.409 2.562-5.409 5.199 0 1.033.394 2.143.889 2.741.099.12.112.225.085.345-.09.375-.293 1.199-.334 1.363-.053.225-.172.271-.402.165-1.495-.69-2.433-2.878-2.433-4.646 0-3.776 2.748-7.252 7.92-7.252 4.158 0 7.392 2.967 7.392 6.923 0 4.135-2.607 7.462-6.233 7.462-1.214 0-2.357-.629-2.75-1.378l-.748 2.853c-.271 1.043-1.002 2.35-1.492 3.146C9.57 23.812 10.763 24.009 12.017 24c6.624 0 11.99-5.367 11.99-12.013C24.007 5.367 18.641.001.017 0z"/>
                </svg>
              </a>
            {% endif %}

            {% if block.settings.social_snapchat_url != blank %}
